# Canonical bytes are LF.
#
# This service carries a pinned copy of the canonical Agent contract material,
# and the drift gate compares it to the Platform tree byte for byte. A checkout
# that rewrites line endings changes those bytes and the comparison stops
# measuring the contract.
#
# `text=auto` lets Git detect binary content and leave it alone; `eol=lf` pins
# the working-tree ending for everything it treats as text, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
